==Battleground==
*20 [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*10 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Maawth]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Elder Sloth]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Nimoy Bore]] spawns.
**5 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**1 [[Bun Bun Symbiote]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Kroxo]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This floor is the blockade for players who haven't collected many [[Into the Future]] [[Treasure]]s. However, having all the [[Plasma Crystal|anti-]][[Aqua Crystal|Alien]] [[Treasure]]s to 100% throughout the three chapters can make this stage much easier. If you do have both the Aqua and Plasma Crystal in all chapters, use common [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Alien]] like [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]] or [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] and you'll win.

